<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="policy-page">
  <div class="policy-container">
    <a href="/listings" class="policy-back">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to StayNest
    </a>

    <header class="policy-header">
      <span class="policy-badge">YOUR PRIVACY MATTERS</span>
      <h1>Privacy <span>Policy</span></h1>
      <p>
        We value your trust. Here's how StayNest collects, uses, and protects
        your information when you use our platform.
      </p>
      <div class="policy-updated">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i>
        Last updated: October 30, 2026
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="policy-layout">
      <nav class="policy-toc">
        <h3>On this page</h3>
        <a href="#information">Information We Collect</a>
        <a href="#usage">How We Use Information</a>
        <a href="#sharing">Information Sharing</a>
        <a href="#security">Data Security</a>
        <a href="#cookies">Cookies</a>
        <a href="#rights">Your Rights</a>
        <a href="#retention">Data Retention</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
      </nav>

      <article class="policy-content">
        <section id="information" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">01</span>
          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you create an account or use StayNest, we may collect
            information that you provide directly to us.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              Account details, such as your name, username, and email address.
            </li>
            <li>
              Contact information, such as your phone number and location, if
              provided.
            </li>
            <li>
              Booking details, including selected properties, dates, and guest
              counts.
            </li>
            <li>
              Information you submit through reviews, forms, or customer
              support.
            </li>
            <li>
              Technical information, such as browser type and basic usage data,
              where collected.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We aim to collect only information that is relevant to providing and
            improving our services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="usage" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">02</span>
          <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>Information may be used to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Create and manage your account.</li>
            <li>Help you explore properties and submit booking requests.</li>
            <li>Communicate booking updates and important service notices.</li>
            <li>Maintain platform security and prevent misuse.</li>
            <li>Improve website functionality and user experience.</li>
            <li>Respond to your questions and support requests.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We will use personal information for purposes compatible with the
            reason it was collected and as permitted by applicable law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="sharing" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">03</span>
          <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
          <p>
            We do not intend to sell your personal information. We may share
            relevant information when necessary to operate StayNest, including:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              With service providers that help operate, host, or secure our
              website.
            </li>
            <li>With payment providers if payment processing is introduced.</li>
            <li>When required by applicable law or a valid legal request.</li>
            <li>
              When reasonably necessary to protect users, our rights, or
              platform security.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We will aim to limit shared information to what is necessary for the
            relevant purpose.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="security" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">04</span>
          <h2>Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            We use reasonable measures intended to protect account information
            against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
          </p>
          <p>
            However, no website or electronic storage system can be guaranteed
            to be completely secure. You should use a strong password and
            protect your account credentials.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="cookies" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">05</span>
          <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            StayNest may use session cookies or similar technologies to maintain
            login sessions, support essential website functions, and remember
            relevant preferences.
          </p>
          <p>
            Browser settings may allow you to control cookies. Disabling certain
            cookies may affect features that depend on them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="rights" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">06</span>
          <h2>Your Privacy Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Depending on applicable law, you may have the right to request
            access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information.
            You may also have rights concerning consent and certain forms of
            data processing.
          </p>
          <p>
            To make a privacy-related request, contact us using the details
            provided below. We may need to verify your identity before
            processing your request.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="retention" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">07</span>
          <h2>Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to provide
            our services, maintain account records, resolve disputes, meet legal
            obligations, and protect platform security.
          </p>
          <p>
            Retention periods depend on the type of information and the purpose
            for which it was collected.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="policy-section">
          <span class="policy-number">08</span>
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your
            information is handled, please contact the StayNest team.
          </p>
          <div class="policy-contact-card">
            <div class="policy-contact-icon">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Privacy enquiries</h3>
              <p>
                Contact the StayNest team through your designated support email.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="policy-notice">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
          <p>
            This page describes general privacy practices for the StayNest
            project. Actual practices may vary according to the features
            implemented and applicable legal requirements.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
